---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Us">
  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="container-custom max-w-4xl">
      <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl mb-8 text-center">
        About Health & Wellness
      </h1>

      <div class="prose-custom">
        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
          We believe that everyone deserves access to trustworthy, evidence-based health information. 
          Our mission is to empower you with practical wellness advice that's grounded in science and 
          easy to implement in your daily life.
        </p>

        <h2>Our Approach</h2>
        <p>
          Every article we publish is carefully researched and based on current scientific evidence. 
          We focus on:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Evidence-Based Content</strong>: All advice is backed by peer-reviewed research</li>
          <li><strong>Practical Application</strong>: Tips you can actually use in real life</li>
          <li><strong>Realistic Expectations</strong>: No quick fixes or miracle cures</li>
          <li><strong>Transparency</strong>: Clear about what we know and don't know</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>What We Cover</h2>
        <p>
          Our content spans multiple areas of health and wellness:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Mental health and emotional wellbeing</li>
          <li>Nutrition and healthy eating habits</li>
          <li>Fitness and physical activity</li>
          <li>Sleep hygiene and rest</li>
          <li>Preventive health measures</li>
          <li>Sustainable lifestyle changes</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Important Disclaimer</h2>
        <div class="p-6 bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-500 rounded-r-xl my-6">
          <p class="text-amber-900 font-medium">
            We are not medical professionals. This website provides general health information for 
            educational purposes only. Always consult with a qualified healthcare provider before 
            making any health decisions or starting any treatment program.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h2>Our Values</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Integrity</strong>: We never make false claims or promote unproven treatments</li>
          <li><strong>Accessibility</strong>: Health information should be easy to understand</li>
          <li><strong>Inclusivity</strong>: Wellness advice for everyone, regardless of background</li>
          <li><strong>Continuous Learning</strong>: We update our content as new research emerges</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
        <p>
          Have questions or suggestions? We'd love to hear from you. 
          <a href="/contact">Contact us here</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
